T:Cradle Song
M:3/4
L:1/8
N:Words by Lady Nairne; Air from R.A. Smith's "Scottish Minstrel"
B:John Greig, Scots Minstrelsie, Vol. III (T.C. & E.C. Jack, 1893, pp. 268-269)
